[en.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_AIR]
Air Force Construction

[en.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_AIR_desc]
Pegasus, balloons, and airships have existed for hundreds or thousands of years, but ponies have never considered forming a true air force. Perhaps that’s why the Storm King and the pirates were able to run rampant in the skies.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_AIR]
空军建设

[zh.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_AIR_desc]
飞马、气球、行空船已经存在不知几百几千年之久，但小马们似乎此前从未考虑过组建一只真正的空军。也许这就是为什么风暴大王和海盗们总能在天空中肆意妄为的原因吧。

